    {
      "title": "IP如何变为商品收入与资金占用？",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "公司将艺术家IP孵化、运营与设计转成手办、搪胶毛绒等产品，经全球零售和线上渠道触达消费者。2025年报物理11—12页将IP和新品运营列为增长驱动，这一归因来自管理层。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "mechanism"
            },
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "alternative"
            },
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "variables"
            },
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "invalidate"
            },
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "IP权利安排、生产备货、店铺租赁和人力共同构成经营投入，销售回款与库存折价决定现金回收。IP、地区和渠道分别提供收入观察切面；成熟同店与新增门店则需要单独分析。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "mechanism"
            },
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "alternative"
            },
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "variables"
            },
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "invalidate"
            },
            {
              "card": "R7bfc89d395aa",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "半年报与Q3更新分别披露了什么？",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "2025收入371.20052亿元、毛利率72.1%。2026H1收入+23.8%、经营溢利+11.3%、归母+10.1%，毛利率69.7%低于同期70.3%。利润增速和毛利率已经给增长质量提出了具体问题。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "Rad6660d577af",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rad6660d577af",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rad6660d577af",
              "field": "mechanism"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rad6660d577af",
              "field": "alternative"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rad6660d577af",
              "field": "variables"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rad6660d577af",
              "field": "invalidate"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rad6660d577af",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "2026Q3官方未审经营更新称总收入同比下降45%—50%，美洲下降70%—75%、亚太下降65%—70%。本次更新披露的是收入区间，完整季度利润和现金流未披露，其降幅留空。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "Rad6660d577af",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rad6660d577af",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
